    "2024 年度江西省绿色制造名单": "2024 Jiangxi Province Green Manufacturing List",
    "2024 年展会展位": "2024 Exhibition Booth",
    "2024 中国国际复合材料工业技术展览会期间，元源新材与江西星科联合参展，重点展示玻璃纤维纱、工业级玻纤布及高性能电子级玻纤布。": "During the 2024 China International Composite Materials Industry Technology Exhibition, Yuanyuan New Materials and Jiangxi Xingke jointly participated in the exhibition, focusing on displaying glass fiber yarn, industrial grade fiberglass cloth and high-performance electronic grade fiberglass cloth.",
    "2025 年 5 月 13 日，元源新材料年产 15 万吨玻璃纤维池窑拉丝及制品生产线项目开工。公开报道将其视为上犹玻纤产业向高端新材料制造升级的重要节点。": "On May 13, 2025, Yuanyuan New Materials’ glass fiber tank kiln drawing and product production line project with an annual output of 150,000 tons started construction. Public reports regard it as an important node in the upgrading of Shangyou's fiberglass industry to high-end new material manufacturing.",
    "2025 年产业营收": "Industry revenue in 2025",
    "2026 年 4 月 12 日，经济日报刊发《聚焦全生命周期需求 江西赣州加快企业梯度培育》，介绍赣州支持企业成长“榕树行动”的具体实践。": "On April 12, 2026, Economic Daily published \"Focusing on Full Life Cycle Demand, Jiangxi Ganzhou Accelerates Gradient Cultivation of Enterprises\", introducing the specific practices of Ganzhou's \"Rong Tree Action\" to support enterprise growth.",
    "2026 年 8 月 30 日，江西日报在头版刊发上犹县产业与县域发展报道。报道介绍，上犹持续聚焦玻纤新型复材、稀土钨新材料和锂电新能源等特色优势产业，以产业链思维推动企业集聚和上下游协同。": "On August 30, 2026, Jiangxi Daily published a report on Shangyou County’s industry and county development on its front page. According to the report, Shangyou continues to focus on characteristic and advantageous industries such as new glass fiber composite materials, new rare earth tungsten materials and lithium battery new energy, and uses industrial chain thinking to promote enterprise agglomeration and upstream and downstream collaboration.",
    "2026 年 8 月 30 日《江西日报》相关版面。图片来源：大江新闻 · 江西日报。": "Relevant pages of \"Jiangxi Daily\" on August 30, 2026. Image source: Dajiang News·Jiangxi Daily.",
    "2026年8月30日江西日报相关头版版面": "Relevant front page of Jiangxi Daily on August 30, 2026",
