    "按玻璃成分、增强性能与用途划分产品系列，帮助采购和技术团队快速定位规格范围。": "Product series are divided by glass composition, enhanced performance and usage to help procurement and technical teams quickly locate specification ranges.",
    "按产品要求完成脱浆、开纤、表面处理与烘干定型，改善布面孔隙和树脂含浸性。": "Complete desizing, fiber opening, surface treatment and drying and shaping according to product requirements to improve fabric pores and resin impregnation.",
    "按发布时间排列。正文为企业官网摘要，事实与数据均标注原始来源。": "Sorted by release date. The main text is a summary of the company's official website, and the facts and figures are marked with the original source.",
    "把电子级玻纤布制造拆解到每一道工序，明确控制项目与前后衔接。": "Break down the manufacturing of electronic-grade fiberglass cloth into every process, and clearly control the project and the connection before and after.",
    "班前沟通，把质量要求落实到当班生产": "Communicate before shift and implement quality requirements into production on shift",
