    "包括采光板用 A318、喷射成型用 A414 和热塑性塑料用 B011 等产品系列。": "Product lines include A318 for lighting panels, A414 for injection molding and B011 for thermoplastics.",
    "薄型电子布、中薄型电子布、标准电子布": "Thin electronic cloth, medium thin electronic cloth, standard electronic cloth",
    "薄型电子级玻纤布": "Thin electronic grade fiberglass cloth",
    "报道发布时称项目预计于 2026 年建成投产。网站仅记录该次开工信息，实际建设和投产进度以项目最新公开信息为准。": "At the time of the report, the project was expected to be completed and put into production in 2026. The website only records the information about the start of construction. The actual construction and production progress are subject to the latest public information of the project.",
    "报道还关注当地以技术创新、人才合作和共享智造提升集群竞争力的做法，为理解星科所处的区域产业环境提供了完整背景。": "The report also focuses on local practices to enhance the competitiveness of clusters through technological innovation, talent cooperation and shared intelligent manufacturing, providing a complete background for understanding the regional industrial environment in which Xingke operates.",
    "报道回顾了上犹近四十年的玻纤产业积累，以及从坩埚拉丝向池窑拉丝、高性能纱线和精密织造持续升级的过程。元源新材与星科电子等企业构成产业链中的关键环节。": "The report reviewed Shangyou’s nearly 40 years of accumulation in the fiberglass industry, as well as the process of continuous upgrading from crucible drawing to kiln drawing, high-performance yarns and precision weaving. Enterprises such as Yuanyuan New Materials and Xingke Electronics form key links in the industrial chain.",
    "报道介绍，上犹县通过“一企一策”和项目服务专班等方式，推动优质存量企业实施增量项目，形成扎根发展、持续壮大的“二期现象”。": "According to the report, Shangyou County has promoted high-quality existing enterprises to implement incremental projects through \"one enterprise, one policy\" and special project service classes, forming a \"second phase phenomenon\" that takes root in development and continues to grow.",
    "报道介绍，相关项目面向电子玻纤纱等产品，旨在提高区域电子信息产业的本地配套能力，并带动产业链上下游企业协同升级。": "According to the report, the relevant projects are aimed at electronic fiberglass yarn and other products, aiming to improve the local supporting capabilities of the regional electronic information industry and drive collaborative upgrading of upstream and downstream enterprises in the industry chain.",
    "报道所述玻纤企业": "Fiberglass companies mentioned in the report",
