    "报道提到，赣州通过深化产业链上下游协作、支持产业集群发展等措施，推动政策、资金和人才等要素向优质企业集聚。": "The report mentioned that Ganzhou has promoted policies, funds, talents and other factors to gather high-quality enterprises through measures such as deepening upstream and downstream collaboration in the industrial chain and supporting the development of industrial clusters.",
    "报道图片与文字记录了元源新材生产车间、实验室和玻纤纱产品，也呈现江西星科电子基材有限公司的生产现场，反映玻纤纱向电子级玻纤布延伸的产业协同。": "The pictures and text of the report record the Yuanyuan New Materials production workshop, laboratory and fiberglass yarn products, and also present the production site of Jiangxi Xingke Electronic Substrate Co., Ltd., reflecting the industrial synergy of extending glass fiber yarn to electronic grade fiberglass cloth.",
    "报道显示，上犹玻纤产品已从安全防护、绿色建材延伸至电子基材等应用领域，产业链覆盖原料、玻纤纱、玻纤布和复合材料制品。": "Reports show that Shangyou's fiberglass products have extended from safety protection and green building materials to electronic substrates and other application fields, and the industrial chain covers raw materials, fiberglass yarn, fiberglass cloth and composite material products.",
    "报道要点": "Highlights of the report",
    "报道以工业强基、文旅赋能和融湾创新为主线，呈现上犹县围绕特色产业构建发展动能的实践。": "The report focuses on strengthening the industrial base, empowering cultural tourism and integrating innovation into the bay, presenting Shangyou County’s practice of building development momentum around characteristic industries.",
    "报道以元源新材为案例，呈现企业依托既有玻纤制造基础，向电子级玻纤纱等更高附加值产品延伸的路径。": "The report takes Yuanyuan New Materials as a case study to show the company's path to relying on its existing glass fiber manufacturing foundation to extend to higher value-added products such as electronic-grade fiberglass yarn.",
    "报道以元源新材为例，介绍企业通过 ERP 系统和智能工业设备推进订单、生产与质检全流程数字化管理。": "The report takes Yuanyuan New Materials as an example to introduce the company's use of ERP systems and intelligent industrial equipment to promote digital management of the entire process of orders, production and quality inspection.",
