    "从丰田喷气织机连续织造，到布面卷绕、后处理和成品周转，以真实生产现场呈现电子级玻纤布的制造过程。": "From continuous weaving on Toyota air-jet looms to cloth winding, post-processing and finished product turnover, the manufacturing process of electronic-grade fiberglass cloth is presented in a real production site.",
    "从公开媒体、政府平台和行业机构中整理与星科制造、区域产业协同直接相关的信息。": "Collate information directly related to Xingke manufacturing and regional industry collaboration from public media, government platforms and industry organizations.",
