    "从经纱准备到成品检验持续记录关键过程，支持批次质量追溯。": "Continuously record key processes from warp preparation to finished product inspection to support batch quality traceability.",
    "从经纱准备到后处理": "From warp preparation to post-processing",
    "从矿物原料到玻纤织物": "From mineral raw materials to fiberglass fabrics",
    "从山区县的产业基础出发，上犹逐步形成覆盖原料、玻纤纱、织物和复合材料制品的五级产业链。": "Starting from the industrial base of mountainous counties, Shangyou has gradually formed a five-level industrial chain covering raw materials, fiberglass yarn, fabrics and composite products.",
    "从生产班组到行业交流，用真实场景记录制造企业的日常。": "From production teams to industry exchanges, real scenes are used to record the daily life of manufacturing companies.",
    "从项目落地到规范制造": "From project implementation to standardized manufacturing",
    "从一条丝到百亿链，上犹玻纤产业聚链成势": "From one piece of silk to tens of billions of chains, the fiberglass industry is gathering momentum",
    "从原料和玻纤纱，到电子布与复合材料终端，上犹正把单个制造环节连接为完整产业链。": "From raw materials and glass fiber yarns to electronic cloth and composite material terminals, Shangyou is connecting individual manufacturing links into a complete industrial chain.",
