    "江西日报报道从企业投资选择出发，观察江西民间投资信心。元源新材结合上犹玻纤产业基础，将电子信息产业对更细玻纤纱的需求作为产品升级方向。": "Jiangxi Daily reported starting from corporate investment choices and observing private investment confidence in Jiangxi. Yuanyuan New Materials combines the foundation of the glass fiber industry with the electronic information industry's demand for finer glass fiber yarns as a product upgrade direction.",
    "江西日报报道上犹工业运行与数字化转型，元源新材通过 ERP 系统和智能设备推进订单、生产、质检协同管理。": "Jiangxi Daily reported on Shangyou’s industrial operations and digital transformation. Yuanyuan New Materials promotes collaborative management of orders, production, and quality inspection through ERP systems and smart equipment.",
    "江西日报报道显示，2025 年一季度上犹新材料、新能源和电子信息三大产业链协同发力，工业运行实现良好开局。": "Jiangxi Daily reported that in the first quarter of 2025, the three major industrial chains of new materials, new energy and electronic information will work together to achieve a good start in industrial operations.",
    "江西日报关注民间投资信心，元源新材向电子信息材料延伸": "Jiangxi Daily pays attention to private investment confidence, Yuanyuan New Materials extends to electronic information materials",
