    "随着相关项目建设，上犹玻纤产业链将进一步完善原材料、中间品与终端产品之间的本地协同。项目后续节点以政府及企业最新公开信息为准。": "With the construction of related projects, the Shangyou fiberglass industry chain will further improve the local synergy between raw materials, intermediate products and end products. The subsequent nodes of the project will be subject to the latest public information from the government and enterprises.",
